  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Rights Connect  2019-2024 (2025) - Child Rights Connect 2019-2023</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child Rights Connect  2019-2024 (2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Rights Connect (CRC) is the largest network for children&#x2019;s rights with more than 80 national, regional and international member organizations. The intervention&apos;s overall goal is to advance the global movement for children&#x2019;s human rights for the full implementation of the UN Convention on the Rights of the Child and its Optional Protocols. CRC&apos;s work is based on three main intervention points:
1. Empowering children&#x2019;s rights defenders
2. Strengthening the UN human rights system 
3. Advancing the global movement for children&#x2019;s human rights. The contribution is 16 million SEK in core support to CRC over a four-year period (2019-2022), consisting of 4 million SEK annually.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child Rights Connect (CRC) utg&#xf6;r det st&#xf6;rsta n&#xe4;tverket f&#xf6;r barns r&#xe4;ttigheter med mer &#xe4;n 80 medlemsorganisationer s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l nationella, regionala och internationella. Insatsen syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja den globala r&#xf6;relsen f&#xf6;r barns m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter genom att st&#xe4;rka den universella ratificeringen av barnkonventionen (UN CRC) och till&#xe4;ggsprotokoll. CRC:s arbete fokuserar p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande omr&#xe5;den:
1. St&#xf6;d till barnr&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare och barn som f&#xf6;rsvarare av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter
2. St&#xe4;rka FN-systemet f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter
3. St&#xe4;rka och samordna den globala r&#xf6;relsen f&#xf6;r barns m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. Insatsen uppg&#xe5;r till 16 MSEK i k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till CRC under en fyra-&#xe5;rsperiod (2019&#x2013;2022), f&#xf6;rdelat p&#xe5; 4 miljoner kronor &#xe5;rligen.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the efforts of  Child Rights Connect (CRC) is to advance the global movement for children&apos;s human rights for the full implementation of the UN Convention on the Rights of the Child and its Optional Protocols. CRC does this by convening and engaging with civil society and other relevant actors, by fostering cooperation, and by empowering childrens rights defenders to meaningfully participate in global advocacy for childrens rights.

The expected outcomes are:
-Advanced recognition, protection and empowerment of childrens human rights defenders, including through child participation at all levels.
-Empowered children&#xb4;s rights defenders in terms of reporting to and cooperating with the Convention on the Rights of the Child Committee in targeted states to advance sustained global engagement.
-Strengthened accountability to children by building synergies between the Convention on the Rights of the Child, the Treaty Bodies, the Human Rights Council, the SDGs and the youth agenda.
-Advanced ratification of OPIC and its strategic use by children&#xb4;s rights defenders.
-More active and balanced membership of CRC.</narrative>
  </description>
